== Notes ==
* This armor is labeled [[Marhan's Grotto armor#Marhan's Grotto Exclusive Armor|Marhan's Grotto Exclusive Armor]] in the [["Resilience"]] monument in the [[Hall of Monuments]].
* The leggings on the male version of this armor wrap around the leg incorrectly, causing clipping with itself.

== Trivia ==
*Unlike other prestige warrior armor sets from Prophecies, this one did not have a head piece for a long time. The helm was finally added with [[Game updates/20070405|April 5th 2007 update]].

